{"v":4,"catch":"這款帶有漫畫元素的益智遊戲正是您想要的！","desc":"《ROMPERS》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1989年發行的一款動作解謎遊戲。\n控制英雄 CHAP，躲避怪物攻擊並收集迷宮中的所有鑰匙。\n用你的全力擊倒石牆來擊敗怪物！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-09-15","genres":["動作","益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/88f4555e111bb6780ab8d05fc540ee70172ef1f2b4a51745e3724ba107c56977.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/28898862b93ae5f39b58a02c50429896e219cbcca3f2bcdd469b314fb61f8c6f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1c9781913514521a0fa2bc05d50b65a6adae80d7afab6fa88500c507f416f11.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6db557f287398e5009859fe35d34e073cb96a4f801cdf0d5b024b1dce77cc4bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9cbccb147d9415a55db8de2f6c56ee58a09ce14914c87054529bf91bb51a6885.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62f4524beb52c4f28fdd5f7a42e6b9a1ff6766fb0e6e0707d37b4f9092100a8c.jpg"],"titleId":"01004ee0184d0000","dlc":[]}